  What an independent model thought
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I threw the design at Qwen 3.8 for an outside read. Its verdict: top-tier in imaging expertise, engineering architecture, and scenario insight. I'll let you judge that claim for yourself rather than parrot the praise — but it was a useful sanity check that the architecture holds up under scrutiny.&lt;/p&gt;

