&lt;li&gt;Are you an autistic professional who has used &lt;strong&gt;AI&lt;/strong&gt; to navigate a hiring process?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you an HR manager who has implemented asynchronous, AI-graded hiring?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

